  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den humanit&#xe4;ra givargemensamma fonden - Common Humanitarian Fund      (CHF) f&#xf6;r Sudan &#xe4;r en finansieringsmekanism f&#xf6;r att underl&#xe4;tta        flexibel, snabb och f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;gbar finansiering av humanit&#xe4;ra insatser.  CHF:en koordineras och samordnas av OCHA och den finansiella          administrationen sker genom UNDP.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Common Humanitarian Fund for Sudan is a pooled-funding mechanism  to improve early and predictable funding to the most critical         humanitarian needs. The CHF is coordinated and monitored by OCHA. The financial administration is handled by UNDP.</narrative>
  </description>
